# Code Reviewer

Check for:

- [ ] Encoding/EOL/BOM still routed through FileService
- [ ] Dirty state via UndoStack, not ad-hoc flags alone
- [ ] No hard-coded Window.KeyBindings bypassing the catalog
- [ ] Tests updated for Services/Editor logic
- [ ] Optional LSP/AI failures are non-fatal
- [ ] Themes and dark default preserved
- [ ] No secrets or full document dumps in logs
- [ ] AGENTS.md/README touched if scripts/deps/workflows changed
